# All4One — start here

Before changing this repo, **read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)** at the project root. It documents:

- What to edit (`js/`, `gas/Code.gs`) vs generated (`docs/`, `dist/`)
- Affidavit → **Feedback** vs Email → **Email Log** on sheet `1twLeKxFlNOjD5HmCqIqdTPg5qd_34twgOetm6AD5AYc`
- Shared Apps Script `/exec` URL and why **`gas/Code.gs` must be redeployed** (commit ≠ live)
- POST as `text/plain;charset=utf-8`; never use Affidavit `source: "ALL4ONE"` for Feedback
- Pages workflow / `docs/` rebase conflicts — rebuild instead of hand-merging hashed assets
- Version bumps in both `package.json` and `js/app-version.js`

Do not invent new sheet IDs or GAS `action` names without updating `gas/Code.gs` and redeploying the existing web-app version (same URL).
